  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#covent_garden"><hi rend="smallcaps">Theatre Royal, Covent-Garden,</hi></placeName><lb/>
               This present <date when="1811-12-06"><hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi>, Dec. 6, 1811</date>, will be acted the Comedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_man_of_the_world">The Man of the World.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Lord Lumbercourt</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Murray</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Pertinax Macsycophant</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grant">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grant</hi>,</actor><lb/>
                     <hi rend="italic">(Being his first appearace in London.)</hi></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Egerton</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ke">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Melville</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#da_eg">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Egerton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Serj. Eitherfide,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_chapman">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chapman</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Counsellor Plausible,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_creswell">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Creswell</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sidney</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_brunton">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Brunton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Tomlins,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_truman">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Truman</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sam,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_we">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">West</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>John,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_at">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Atkins</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Rodolpha Lumbercourt</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#na_jo">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">H. Johnston</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Macsycophant</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#an_ma_le">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Leserve</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Constantia</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bolton">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bolton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Betty Hint</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added a musical Farce called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_rosina"><hi rend="allcaps">Rosina</hi>.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Belville</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_broadhurst">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Broadhurst</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Capt. Belville</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_shaw">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Rustick</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_treby">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Treby</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>William,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_taylor">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Patrick,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hamerton">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hamerton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Phelim,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_williams">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Williams</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rosina</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_emery">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Emery</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Doors will be opened at <time when="17:30:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Half</hi> past <hi rend="allcaps">Five</hi></time>, and the Play begin at <time when="18:30:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Half</hi> past <hi rend="allcaps">Six</hi></time>.<lb/>
               Vivant Rex &amp; Regina.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
